(23364, '_transient_amp_themes_wporg', 'O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:4:\"info\";a:3:{s:4:\"page\";i:1;s:5:\"pages\";i:1;s:7:\"results\";i:21;}s:6:\"themes\";a:21:{i:0;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Twenty Twenty-Five\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"twentytwentyfive\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"1.4\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:39:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentytwentyfive/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:21:\"https://wordpress.org\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:68:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentytwentyfive/screenshot.png?ver=1.4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:82;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:11;s:8:\"homepage\";s:46:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentytwentyfive/\";s:11:\"description\";s:625:\"O Twenty Twenty-Five enfatiza simplicidade e adaptabilidade. Oferece opções de design flexíveis, apoiadas por uma variedade de padrões para diferentes tipos de página, como serviços e páginas de entrada, tornando-o ideal para a criação de blogs pessoais, portfólios profissionais, revistas on-line ou sites de negócios. Os seus modelos satisfazem vários estilos de blog, desde leiautes focados em textos até aqueles largamente baseados em imagens. Além disso, oferece suporte a tipografia internacional e a diversas palhetas de cores, garantindo acessibilidade e personalização para usuários de todo o mundo.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"6.7\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.2\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:18:\"Twenty Twenty-Four\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"twentytwentyfour\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"1.4\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:39:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentytwentyfour/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:21:\"https://wordpress.org\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:68:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentytwentyfour/screenshot.png?ver=1.4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:76;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:36;s:8:\"homepage\";s:46:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentytwentyfour/\";s:11:\"description\";s:585:\"Twenty Twenty-Four é projetado para ser flexível, versátil e aplicável para qualquer site. Sua coleção de modelos e padrões se molda para diferentes necessidades, como apresentar um negócio, escrever um blog ou mostrar um trabalho. Uma multidão de possibilidades se abrem com apenas alguns ajustes de cor e tipografia. Twenty Twenty-Four vem com variações de estilo e designs de página completa para ajudar a acelerar o processo de montar o site, é totalmente compatível com o editor do site e tem a vantagem das novas ferramentas de design introduzidas no WordPress 6.4.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"6.4\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:45:\"https://github.com/WordPress/twentytwentyfour\";}i:2;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:9:\"Blue Note\";s:4:\"slug\";s:9:\"blue-note\";s:7:\"version\";s:5:\"1.0.2\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:32:\"https://wp-themes.com/blue-note/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:52:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/author/wordpressdotorg/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:63:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/blue-note/screenshot.png?ver=1.0.2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:100;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:1;s:8:\"homepage\";s:39:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/blue-note/\";s:11:\"description\";s:218:\"Blue Note é um tema de blocos elegante e divertido, inspirado pelo jazz e pela gravador \"Blue Note Records\". Sua tipografia atemporal e seus leiautes modernos e responsivos são perfeitos para escritores e blogueiros.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"6.1\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.4\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:19:\"Twenty Twenty-Three\";s:4:\"slug\";s:17:\"twentytwentythree\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"1.6\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:40:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentytwentythree/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:21:\"https://wordpress.org\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:69:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentytwentythree/screenshot.png?ver=1.6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:68;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:62;s:8:\"homepage\";s:47:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentytwentythree/\";s:11:\"description\";s:468:\"O Twenty Twenty-Three foi projetado para aproveitar as novas ferramentas de design introduzidas no WordPress 6.1. Com uma base limpa e em branco como ponto de partida, este tema padrão inclui dez variações de estilo diversas criadas por membros da comunidade WordPress. Se você deseja criar um site complexo ou incrivelmente simples, pode fazê-lo de maneira rápida e intuitiva por meio dos estilos agrupados ou mergulhar na criação e personalização completa.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"6.1\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"5.6\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Twenty Twenty-One\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"twentytwentyone\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"2.7\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:38:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentytwentyone/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:67:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentytwentyone/screenshot.png?ver=2.7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:84;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:45;s:8:\"homepage\";s:45:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentytwentyone/\";s:11:\"description\";s:398:\"O Twenty Twenty-One é uma tela em branco para suas idéias e faz do editor de blocos o seu melhor pincel. Com novos padrões de blocos, que lhe permitem criar um belo layout em questão de segundos, as cores suaves deste tema e o design atraente - mas atemporal - farão seu trabalho brilhar. Experimente! Veja como o Twenty Twenty-One eleva seu portfólio, seu site comercial ou seu blog pessoal.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.3\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"5.6\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:13:\"Twenty Twenty\";s:4:\"slug\";s:12:\"twentytwenty\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"3.0\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:35:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentytwenty/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:64:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentytwenty/screenshot.png?ver=3.0\";s:6:\"rating\";i:88;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:68;s:8:\"homepage\";s:42:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentytwenty/\";s:11:\"description\";s:768:\"O nosso tema padrão para 2020 foi desenvolvido para tirar o máximo de proveito da flexibilidade do editor de blocos. Organizações e negócios conseguem criar páginas de conversão dinâmicas com layouts infinitos usando blocos de grupo e coluna. A coluna de conteúdo centralizada e a tipografia refinada também o tornam perfeito para blogs tradicionais. Os estilos prontos do editor fornecem uma boa ideia de como será o seu conteúdo, mesmo antes de você publicar. Você pode dar um toque pessoal ao seu site alterando as cores do plano de fundo e a cor de destaque no Personalizar. As cores de todos os elementos são calculadas automaticamente com base nas cores escolhidas para o site, garantindo um alto contraste de cores acessível aos seus visitantes.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"4.7\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:5:\"5.2.4\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:6;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"Twenty Nineteen\";s:4:\"slug\";s:14:\"twentynineteen\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"3.2\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:37:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentynineteen/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:66:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentynineteen/screenshot.png?ver=3.2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:74;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:63;s:8:\"homepage\";s:44:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentynineteen/\";s:11:\"description\";s:640:\"Nosso design do tema padrão de 2019 foi desenvolvido para mostrar o poder do editor de blocos. Ele possui recursos e estilos personalizados para todos os blocos padrão e foi construído para que o que você vê no editor se pareça com o que você verá no seu site. O Twenty Nineteen foi concebido para ser adaptável a uma vasta gama de sites, quer esteja a publicar um blog fotográfico, a lançar um novo negócio ou a apoiar uma organização sem fins lucrativos. Apresentando com amplo espaço em branco e modernas sans-serif combinadas com texto clássico com serif, ele é construído para ser bonito em todos os tamanhos de tela.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"4.7\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:5:\"5.2.4\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:7;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"Twenty Seventeen\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"twentyseventeen\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"4.0\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:38:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentyseventeen/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:67:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentyseventeen/screenshot.png?ver=4.0\";s:6:\"rating\";i:90;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:118;s:8:\"homepage\";s:45:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentyseventeen/\";s:11:\"description\";s:441:\"Twenty Seventeen dá vida ao seu site com o vídeo de cabeçalho e imagens destacadas imersivas. Focado em sites empresariais, possui suporte para múltiplas seções na página inicial, widgets, navegação, menu de redes sociais, logo e muito mais. Personalize sua grade assimétrica com um padrão de cores e exiba seu conteúdo com formatos de posts. Nosso tema padrão para 2017 funciona perfeitamente em vários idiomas e dispositivos.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"4.7\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:5:\"5.2.4\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:8;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:14:\"Twenty Sixteen\";s:4:\"slug\";s:13:\"twentysixteen\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"3.7\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:36:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentysixteen/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:65:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentysixteen/screenshot.png?ver=3.7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:82;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:83;s:8:\"homepage\";s:43:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentysixteen/\";s:11:\"description\";s:443:\"Twenty Sixteen é uma abordagem modernizada de um sempre popular template para WordPress — O cabeçalho horizontal com barra lateral direita opcional funciona perfeitamente para blogs e sites. Tem opções de cores personalizadas com belos esquemas de cores por padrão, uma harmoniosa grade fluida usando abordagem mobile-first e um polimento impecável em cada detalhe. Twenty Sixteen fará seu WordPress parecer lindo em todos os lugares.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"4.4\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:5:\"5.2.4\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:9;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:14:\"Twenty Fifteen\";s:4:\"slug\";s:13:\"twentyfifteen\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"4.1\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:36:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentyfifteen/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:65:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentyfifteen/screenshot.png?ver=4.1\";s:6:\"rating\";i:88;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:54;s:8:\"homepage\";s:43:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentyfifteen/\";s:11:\"description\";s:430:\"Nosso tema padrão 2015 é simples, focado em blogs e desenhado para maior clareza. A tipografia simples e direta do Twenty Fifteen é legível em uma ampla variedade de tamanhos de telas e adequada a vários idiomas. Desenvolvemos o design utilizando uma abordagem mobile-first, ou seja, seu conteúdo é o centro das atenções, não importando se seus visitantes acessam via smartphone, tablet, laptop ou um computador desktop.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"4.1\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:5:\"5.2.4\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:10;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"Twenty Fourteen\";s:4:\"slug\";s:14:\"twentyfourteen\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"4.4\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:37:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentyfourteen/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:66:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentyfourteen/screenshot.png?ver=4.4\";s:6:\"rating\";i:88;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:97;s:8:\"homepage\";s:44:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentyfourteen/\";s:11:\"description\";s:456:\"Em 2014, nosso tema padrão permite que você crie um site de revista responsivo com um design elegante e moderno. Destaque seu conteúdo favorito na Página Inicial em um grid ou em um slider. Use as três áreas de widgets para personalizar seu site, mude o layout de seu conteúdo com o modelo de página sem barra lateral e com a página de contribuidores para exibir os autores de seu site. Nunca foi tão fácil criar um site de revista no WordPress.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"3.6\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:5:\"5.2.4\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:11;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"Twenty Thirteen\";s:4:\"slug\";s:14:\"twentythirteen\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"4.5\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:37:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentythirteen/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:66:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentythirteen/screenshot.png?ver=4.5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:82;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:62;s:8:\"homepage\";s:44:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentythirteen/\";s:11:\"description\";s:330:\"O tema Twenty Thirteen nos leva de volta ao blog, destacando-se todos os formatos de posts, cada um exibido de forma elegante e única. São vários detalhes, começando com uma combinação de cores vibrantes e cabeçalho, bela tipografia e ícones, e um layout flexível que se adapta a qualquer dispositivo, pequeno ou grande. \";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"3.6\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:5:\"5.2.4\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:12;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:13:\"Twenty Twelve\";s:4:\"slug\";s:12:\"twentytwelve\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"4.7\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:35:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentytwelve/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:64:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentytwelve/screenshot.png?ver=4.7\";s:6:\"rating\";i:92;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:159;s:8:\"homepage\";s:42:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentytwelve/\";s:11:\"description\";s:424:\"O tema 2012 do WordPress é um tema totalmente responsivo que fica bem em qualquer dispositivo. As funcionalidades incluem um modelo de página inicial com seus próprios widgets, uma fonte de exibição opcional, estilos para formatos de posts tanto na página inicial quanto em páginas individuais  e um modelo de página opcional sem a barra lateral. Personalize o tema com menu, imagem de cabeçalho, e imagem de fundo.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"3.5\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:5:\"5.2.4\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:13;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:13:\"Twenty Eleven\";s:4:\"slug\";s:12:\"twentyeleven\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:35:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentyeleven/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:64:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentyeleven/screenshot.png?ver=5.0\";s:6:\"rating\";i:92;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:50;s:8:\"homepage\";s:42:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentyeleven/\";s:11:\"description\";s:896:\"O tema de 2011 do WordPress é sofisticado, leve, e adaptável. Faça-o seu com um menu, imagem de cabeçalho e fundo personalizados — e então vá para as opções do tema completas para escolher um esquema de cores branco ou preto, cores dos links e três esquemas de leiaute. O Twenty Eleven vem equipado com um modelo de página Vitrine, que transforma sua página inicial em uma vitrine para exibir o seu melhor conteúdo; suporte a galeria de widgets (barra lateral, três áreas no rodapé e uma área para o modelo Vitrine); e um widget personalizado chamado \"Efêmera\" para exibir seus posts de Notas, Links, Citações ou Status. Inclui estilos para impressão e para o editor do painel, suporte a imagens destacadas (como imagens de cabeçalho personalizadas em posts e páginas e como imagens destacadas em posts \"fixos\"), e estilos especiais para seis formatos de posts diferentes.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"3.2\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:5:\"5.2.4\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:14;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:10:\"Twenty Ten\";s:4:\"slug\";s:9:\"twentyten\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"4.5\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:32:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentyten/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:61:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentyten/screenshot.png?ver=4.5\";s:6:\"rating\";i:94;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:54;s:8:\"homepage\";s:39:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentyten/\";s:11:\"description\";s:565:\"O tema 2010 para WordPress é classudo, personalizável, simples e legível -- torne-o seu com um menu personalizado, imagem de cabeçalho e de fundo. O Twenty Ten suporta seis áreas de widgets (duas na sidebar, quatro no rodapé) e imagens destacadas (miniaturas para posts de galerias e imagens de cabeçalho personalizadas para posts e páginas). Ele inclui folhas de estilos para impressão e para o Editor Visual, estilos especiais para posts nas categorias \"Notas\" e \"Galeria\", e possui um modelo opcional de página de uma coluna que remove a barra lateral.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"3.0\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:5:\"5.2.4\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:15;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:6:\"Darken\";s:4:\"slug\";s:6:\"darken\";s:7:\"version\";s:5:\"1.0.0\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:29:\"https://wp-themes.com/darken/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:52:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/author/wordpressdotorg/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:60:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/darken/screenshot.png?ver=1.0.0\";s:6:\"rating\";i:0;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:0;s:8:\"homepage\";s:36:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/darken/\";s:11:\"description\";s:306:\"Darken is a meticulously designed theme for portfolio and blog websites. It features a perfect blend of fonts and colors, offering a visually appealing experience. With built-in editor styles, you can effortlessly switch your website to dark mode. This theme is modern, responsive, and optimized for speed.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"6.2\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"5.7\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:16;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:6:\"Stacks\";s:4:\"slug\";s:6:\"stacks\";s:7:\"version\";s:5:\"0.0.3\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:29:\"https://wp-themes.com/stacks/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:52:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/author/wordpressdotorg/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:60:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/stacks/screenshot.png?ver=0.0.3\";s:6:\"rating\";i:100;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:2;s:8:\"homepage\";s:36:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/stacks/\";s:11:\"description\";s:169:\"Stack your story. This theme is designed specifically to create slide decks that can be used as a presentation. The \"Stacks\" pattern can be included on any page or post.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"6.2\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"5.7\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:17;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Twenty Twenty-Two\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"twentytwentytwo\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"2.1\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:38:\"https://wp-themes.com/twentytwentytwo/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:67:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/twentytwentytwo/screenshot.png?ver=2.1\";s:6:\"rating\";i:64;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:70;s:8:\"homepage\";s:45:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/twentytwentytwo/\";s:11:\"description\";s:933:\"Built on a solidly designed foundation, Twenty Twenty-Two embraces the idea that everyone deserves a truly unique website. The theme’s subtle styles are inspired by the diversity and versatility of birds: its typography is lightweight yet strong, its color palette is drawn from nature, and its layout elements sit gently on the page. The true richness of Twenty Twenty-Two lies in its opportunity for customization. The theme is built to take advantage of the Site Editor features introduced in WordPress 5.9, which means that colors, typography, and the layout of every single page on your site can be customized to suit your vision. It also includes dozens of block patterns, opening the door to a wide range of professionally designed layouts in just a few clicks. Whether you’re building a single-page website, a blog, a business website, or a portfolio, Twenty Twenty-Two will help you create a site that is uniquely yours.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.9\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"5.6\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:18;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:10:\"TT1 Blocks\";s:4:\"slug\";s:10:\"tt1-blocks\";s:7:\"version\";s:5:\"0.4.8\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:33:\"https://wp-themes.com/tt1-blocks/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";s:18:\"the WordPress team\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:22:\"https://wordpress.org/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:64:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/tt1-blocks/screenshot.png?ver=0.4.8\";s:6:\"rating\";i:0;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:0;s:8:\"homepage\";s:40:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/tt1-blocks/\";s:11:\"description\";s:240:\"TT1 Blocks is an experimental block-based version of the Twenty Twenty-One theme. It is built to leverage the full-site editing functionality that is being built in the Gutenberg plugin. This theme is not meant for use on a production site.\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.6\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"5.6\";s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:19;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:7:\"Classic\";s:4:\"slug\";s:7:\"classic\";s:7:\"version\";s:3:\"1.6\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:30:\"https://wp-themes.com/classic/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";b:0;s:10:\"author_url\";b:0;}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:59:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/classic/screenshot.png?ver=1.6\";s:6:\"rating\";i:100;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:1;s:8:\"homepage\";s:37:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/classic/\";s:11:\"description\";s:66:\"The original WordPress theme that graced versions 1.2.x and prior.\";s:8:\"requires\";b:0;s:12:\"requires_php\";b:0;s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}i:20;O:8:\"stdClass\":16:{s:4:\"name\";s:7:\"Default\";s:4:\"slug\";s:7:\"default\";s:7:\"version\";s:5:\"1.7.2\";s:11:\"preview_url\";s:30:\"https://wp-themes.com/default/\";s:6:\"author\";a:6:{s:13:\"user_nicename\";s:15:\"wordpressdotorg\";s:7:\"profile\";s:47:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wordpressdotorg/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/178f40079143ff7464125e4fbc88e62024a16442920a6a3d6dfa3d7e626be20d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:13:\"WordPress.org\";s:6:\"author\";b:0;s:10:\"author_url\";s:24:\"http://binarybonsai.com/\";}s:14:\"screenshot_url\";s:61:\"//ts.w.org/wp-content/themes/default/screenshot.png?ver=1.7.2\";s:6:\"rating\";i:100;s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:3;s:8:\"homepage\";s:37:\"https://wordpress.org/themes/default/\";s:11:\"description\";s:96:\"The default WordPress theme that graced version 1.5 to version 2.9, based on the famous Kubrick.\";s:8:\"requires\";b:0;s:12:\"requires_php\";b:0;s:13:\"is_commercial\";b:0;s:20:\"external_support_url\";b:0;s:12:\"is_community\";b:1;s:23:\"external_repository_url\";s:0:\"\";}}}', 'off'),
